Z||000003||Gonzo_442||11-10-2001||01:42 PM||||i got the set from the fierostore. one thing i noticed when putting the new hoses on though, they're a tad short with the stock suspension. approx 1"  they work, but you can't put them back in the stock clamp/retainer. maybe this is because most people lower the suspension an inch?<P>otoh, they're on my 87 now for almost 6 months, haven't had any real problems with them. just a little note. ymmv.<BR>--<BR>g||||reg||1
